│                          │ - mirrored parameter sharing across qubit pairs to regularize and reduce overfitting,     │
│                          │ - interleaved CZ, RZ, CRY, and CNOT layers to create stronger non-commuting mixing,       │
│                          │ - long-range controlled rotations to better propagate the fixed feature-map correlations  │
│                          │ across the register.                                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should preserve high train accuracy while improving generalization, reducing the     │
│                          │ train-test gap, and reaching strong validation performance with fewer effective degrees   │
